msgid "None of these versions is published to npm: the registry's newest `transactions` is still 5.0.1. These docs keep pinning the published versions listed in the {doc}`TypeScript SDK <04_building-apps/sdk/01_typescript>` page, and will move to the new majors once they are on npm."
